  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Solar Panels for &quot;Space4All&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Electricity in the community where Space4all is located is powered by a state-owned power company in Zambia; still, the cost is very high and the supply is very unreliable. Unreliable electricity makes it difficult to operate Space4all at efficiently full capacity every day. Installing Solar Panels will provide Space4all with environment-friendly renewable energy and a dependable source of unlimited cost-efficient energy, allowing us to run the centre effectively without interruptions.</narrative>
  </description>
